WEBVTT

00:00:00.672 --> 00:00:04.953
Calibrate the ground floor drawing with the 10 m dimension. Trace the wall and mark the 3 m span between the bearing centres.

00:00:04.953 --> 00:00:08.335
Open a lintel from the saved wall and bearing marks. The reference records the drawing revision, page, calibration and measured span.

00:00:08.335 --> 00:00:13.534
Inspect the alternating diagonal webs through the continuous translucent face plates. Use Frame only to see the C sections.

00:00:13.534 --> 00:00:20.685
Compare steel without webs and solid timber. For the worked calculation, return to the diagonal steel assembly and choose the roof and solar load preset.

00:00:20.685 --> 00:00:24.641
Review the calculated service and ultimate cases and support reactions, then save the lintel in your private library.

00:00:24.641 --> 00:00:33.097
Issue the saved lintel in Project Summary. The appendix records the geometry, the original marks, applied loads and the reactions for each combination.
